    cat: "geopolitica",
    title: "Watch: Was Trump smuggled out of Air Force One in a catering truck?",
    summary: "US media reports say the president secretly left via a catering truck to avoid a threat to his life from Iran.",
    preview: "Watch: Was Trump smuggled out of Air Force One in a catering truck? Donald Trump secretly switched planes when he was returning from a Nato meeting last month in order to avoid a threat to his life from Iran, US media has reported. The president boarded Air Force One in Ankara, Turkey, on 8 July before being transported to another aircraft with the help of a catering truck, the Washington Post said. He was then seen disembarking Air Force One in the UK, before boarding his newer, Qatari-gifted jet and returning to the US.",
    body: "Watch: Was Trump smuggled out of Air Force One in a catering truck?\n\nDonald Trump secretly switched planes when he was returning from a Nato meeting last month in order to avoid a threat to his life from Iran, US media has reported.\n\nThe president boarded Air Force One in Ankara, Turkey, on 8 July before being transported to another aircraft with the help of a catering truck, the Washington Post said.\n\nHe was then seen disembarking Air Force One in the UK, before boarding his newer, Qatari-gifted jet and returning to the US.\n\nTrump spoke to journalists during his flight to the US but did not say whether he had been moved to a different plane.\n\nThe BBC's diplomatic correspondent Paul Adams explains.\n\n- More on this story: Trump hid in catering truck in secret plane swap over Iran threat, reports say\n\nRelated topics\n\n- United StatesUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n\n- Donald TrumpUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n\n- IranUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.",
