    summary: "President Masoud Pezeshkian says Supreme Leader Mojtaba Khamenei is in ‘perfect health’.",
    preview: "War on Iran: Mojtaba Khamenei in ‘perfect health’, Iran says NewsFeed War on Iran: Mojtaba Khamenei is in ‘perfect health’, Iran says President Masoud Pezeshkian says Supreme Leader Mojtaba Khamenei is in ‘perfect health’, as Iran undergoes a security shakeup with several senior commanders appointed to new roles, while Washington and Tehran continue to demand compensation from one another over the war. Al Jazeera’s Marah Rayan has the latest.",
    body: "War on Iran: Mojtaba Khamenei in ‘perfect health’, Iran says\n\nNewsFeed\n\nWar on Iran: Mojtaba Khamenei is in ‘perfect health’, Iran says\n\nPresident Masoud Pezeshkian says Supreme Leader Mojtaba Khamenei is in ‘perfect health’, as Iran undergoes a security shakeup with several senior commanders appointed to new roles, while Washington and Tehran continue to demand compensation from one another over the war. Al Jazeera’s Marah Rayan has the latest.",
